{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24089","headline":"东归 · 白居易","name":"东归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"翩翩平肩舆，中有醉老夫。\n膝上展诗卷，竿头悬酒壶。\n食宿无定程，仆马多缓驱。\n临水歇半日，望山倾一盂。\n藉草坐嵬峩，攀花行踟蹰。\n风将景共暖，体与心同舒。\n始悟有营者，居家如在途。\n方知无系者，在道如安居。\n前夕宿三堂，今旦游申湖。\n残春三百里，送我归东都。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24089.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24089","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}